"Checking files…" = "正在检查文件…";
"Discard this pending copy? Source files and published notes stay untouched." = "丢弃这个待处理副本？来源文件和已导入的笔记会保留。";
"Read included content" = "查看包含的内容";
"Notes: %lld · Review pages: %lld" = "笔记：%lld · 回顾页面：%lld";
"Attachments: %lld" = "附件：%lld";
"Imported into a new notebook. Existing notes were not replaced." = "已导入新的笔记本，现有笔记没有被替换。";
"Exchange stopped. Pending copies remain available to review." = "交换已停止，待处理副本仍可查看。";
"The exchange could not be completed. Original files were preserved." = "未能完成文件交换，原文件已保留。";
"The export was not completed. Your notebook is unchanged." = "导出未完成，你的笔记本没有改变。";
"This exchange could not be verified. Original files were preserved." = "无法验证这份交换文件，原文件已保留。";
