"The selected files changed. Preview the exchange again." = "选中的文件有改动，请重新预览。";
"A different import already occupies this namespace. Nothing was replaced." = "这个命名空间已被另一份导入占用，没有替换任何内容。";
"Select the same source folder again to resume this import." = "请重新选择同一来源文件夹以继续导入。";
"Review or discard pending imports before adding another exchange." = "请先查看或丢弃待处理导入，再添加新的交换文件。";
